{"3679880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spaceship Scavenger", "steam_appid": 3679880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DIVE INTO THE HULL FROZEN IN TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a contracted scavenger for Voidhaul, your mission is simple: retrieve the ship’s Core intact, or don’t come back at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvage valuable cores from abandoned spaceships in a physics-driven race against time, where your biggest prize becomes your heaviest burden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/e456fb5bfcf7cd6f617e713fc4538094.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/e456fb5bfcf7cd6f617e713fc4538094.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/e456fb5bfcf7cd6f617e713fc4538094.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Dive further into the hull</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PLAN YOUR ESCAPE BEFORE THE HEAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate forgotten ship corridors and manage your resources to proceed. Plan your route carefully, use your limited tools wisely, and make your escape with the Core before it overheats disintegrating the ship, and you with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/7b132940ea98039d057402b0761bc74d.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/7b132940ea98039d057402b0761bc74d.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/7b132940ea98039d057402b0761bc74d.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The Core</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the Core is disconnected, the clock starts ticking. Mark your escape route, keep your head cool, and make it out before the hull becomes your tomb.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/5cb8671a19960a435081279be681e7c2.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/5cb8671a19960a435081279be681e7c2.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/5cb8671a19960a435081279be681e7c2.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/840de9f6f322989f5a2449827598db55.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/840de9f6f322989f5a2449827598db55.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/840de9f6f322989f5a2449827598db55.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SCAVENGER'S TOOLKIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your scavenger toolkit to chart your path or improvise on the fly. Every scavenger has to equip themselves to face the challenges hidden in each ship’s hull. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/2006c8f9d934c013fb37b5e74b619788.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/2006c8f9d934c013fb37b5e74b619788.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/2006c8f9d934c013fb37b5e74b619788.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your<strong> Multitool </strong>has a <strong>grapple mode </strong>to move objects around…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/68b01b19ec28a7c9eb48e15be51080ba.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/68b01b19ec28a7c9eb48e15be51080ba.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/68b01b19ec28a7c9eb48e15be51080ba.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">… And a <strong>cutting mode </strong>to get through more solid obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/c672df63fdb8821f36c906110006c2fa.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/c672df63fdb8821f36c906110006c2fa.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/c672df63fdb8821f36c906110006c2fa.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use <strong>the</strong> <strong>hacking module </strong>to access and bypass the ship’s internal systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/4e412243a008b655a118e24f404f4b39.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/4e412243a008b655a118e24f404f4b39.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/4e412243a008b655a118e24f404f4b39.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Navigate and analyze your surroundings with <strong>the</strong> <strong>scanner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/7db4683057d176df98fdfa68e26948c3.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/7db4683057d176df98fdfa68e26948c3.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/7db4683057d176df98fdfa68e26948c3.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Scavenge</strong> resources to keep yourself up to the task. Oxygen and energy supplies are limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>REMEMBER, THE CORE ALWAYS COMES FIRST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only mission is to retrieve the core intact. Everything else is expendable. Voidhaul doesn’t pay for blown cargo or empty hands. Leave the ship without the core, and you have failed your contract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Zero-Gravity Gameplay:</strong> Navigate derelict interiors with realistic momentum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenger’s Toolkit:</strong> Cut, hack, and grapple your way through debris and locked systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Salvage Resources:</strong> Earn profit in the side and upgrade your gear by scavenging salvage found during the missions. Watch out for your total weight: it may affect your maneuvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Extraction:</strong> Explore the ships while proceeding further and planning for the escape. Once the Core is detached, survival becomes your only goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Storyline:</strong> Experience Voidhaul’s cold corporate grip on deep-space salvage from a scavenger’s perspective.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/26f0c55a2b3851fb69e287f94676e35f.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/26f0c55a2b3851fb69e287f94676e35f.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/26f0c55a2b3851fb69e287f94676e35f.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/d2523c093492e8c91f6d17bb53e1986f.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/d2523c093492e8c91f6d17bb53e1986f.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/d2523c093492e8c91f6d17bb53e1986f.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While in there, don't let your guard down - <i>the dormant ships are notoriously far from safe.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"