/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/c672df63fdb8821f36c906110006c2fa.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/c672df63fdb8821f36c906110006c2fa.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/c672df63fdb8821f36c906110006c2fa.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use <strong>the</strong> <strong>hacking module </strong>to access and bypass the ship’s internal systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/4e412243a008b655a118e24f404f4b39.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/4e412243a008b655a118e24f404f4b39.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/4e412243a008b655a118e24f404f4b39.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Navigate and analyze your surroundings with <strong>the</strong> <strong>scanner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/7db4683057d176df98fdfa68e26948c3.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/7db4683057d176df98fdfa68e26948c3.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/7db4683057d176df98fdfa68e26948c3.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Scavenge</strong> resources to keep yourself up to the task. Oxygen and energy supplies are limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>REMEMBER, THE CORE ALWAYS COMES FIRST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only mission is to retrieve the core intact. Everything else is expendable. Voidhaul doesn’t pay for blown cargo or empty hands. Leave the ship without the core, and you have failed your contract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Zero-Gravity Gameplay:</strong> Navigate derelict interiors with realistic momentum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenger’s Toolkit:</strong> Cut, hack, and grapple your way through debris and locked systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Salvage Resources:</strong> Earn profit in the side and upgrade your gear by scavenging salvage found during the missions. Watch out for your total weight: it may affect your maneuvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Extraction:</strong> Explore the ships while proceeding further and planning for the escape. Once the Core is detached, survival becomes your only goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Storyline:</strong> Experience Voidhaul’s cold corporate grip on deep-space salvage from a scavenger’s perspective.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/26f0c55a2b3851fb69e287f94676e35f.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/26f0c55a2b3851fb69e287f94676e35f.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/26f0c55a2b3851fb69e287f94676e35f.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/d2523c093492e8c91f6d17bb53e1986f.poster.avif?t=1770846166\" width=506 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/d2523c093492e8c91f6d17bb53e1986f.webm?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/extras/d2523c093492e8c91f6d17bb53e1986f.mp4?t=1770846166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While in there, don't let your guard down - <i>the dormant ships are notoriously far from safe.</i></p>", "short_description": "Board a derelict ship frozen in time. Use your scavenger tools to cut, hack, and grapple through its corridors. Retrieve the invaluable Core intact and make your escape before the ship, and you, are lost to the void.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/7e5d26ac417ecee9825f7ad562dbd0533449022e/header.jpg?t=1770846166", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/4e432d819ad14dcc003e2780c3833b06d3c878d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770846166", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679880/4e432d819ad14dcc003e2780c3833b06d3c878d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770846166", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 - 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 3 3100 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 (3GB) / AMD RX 580 / Intel Arc A380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD strongly recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 - 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 / AMD RX 6600 XT or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD strongly recommended</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_